      "roles": ["CREATOR"],
      "accessibility": "Keyboard activation, Enter to apply title, Escape to cancel or close Details, restored focus, native form controls and visible save feedback remain usable on desktop and mobile.",
      "fallback": "Manual creation requires no AI, imported document or whole-Chronicle template. The other three choices visibly say Coming soon and cannot create drafts.",
      "navigation": "Creator Library opens Create a Chronicle; manual creation opens the existing TaleEditor; Details stays within that editor and returning reaches the same Creator Library.",
